# --- 21 Oct 2026 (code review, repo hygiene): QA working files stay on this Mac ---
# Reports (.md), proposals (.json), review pages (.html) and scripts under qa/ stay in git. Screenshots, renders, films,
# sound, dumps and caches do not: they are 11 GB on this Mac and would block a push. Use git add -f only for one small
# image a report must show. The site's own large files live in dist/ and media/, outside these rules.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
qa/**/*.png
qa/**/*.jpg
qa/**/*.jpeg
qa/**/*.gif
qa/**/*.webp
qa/**/*.avif
qa/**/*.tif
qa/**/*.tiff
qa/**/*.psd
